{"id":"7cc200a77aab727f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_SubstL.md","title":"SubstL","display":"SubstL","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"SubstL","parameters":["s","a","b"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"SubstL"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>s</span><span>a</span><span>b</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命题语法。有序参数：<code>s</code>、<code>a</code>、<code>b</code>。</p>\n<p>同步命题替换；存在的是固定公式集合上的图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ SubstL s a b)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists f\n  (exists w\n    (exists h\n      (and\n        (@ FormSetL f)\n        (and\n          (@ Omega w)\n          (and\n            (@ Map s w f)\n            (and\n              (@ Map h f f)\n              (and\n                (in a f)\n                (and\n                  (@ App h a b)\n                  (and\n                    (forall n\n                      (forall t (implies (and (@ Nat n) (@ PAtom n t)) (forall u (iff (@ App h t u) (@ App s n u))))))\n                    (and\n                      (forall z184\n                        (forall z186\n                          (implies\n                            (and (in z184 f) (@ PNeg z184 z186))\n                            (exists z185 (exists z187 (and (@ App h z184 z185) (and (@ PNeg z185 z187) (@ App h z186 z187))))))))\n                      (and\n                        (forall z188\n                          (forall z189\n                            (forall z192\n                            (implies\n                            (and (in z188 f) (and (in z189 f) (@ PImp z188 z189 z192)))\n                            (exists z190\n                            (exists z191\n                            (exists z193\n                            (and (@ App h z188 z190) (and (@ App h z189 z191) (and (@ PImp z190 z191 z193) (@ App h z192 z193)))))))))))\n                        (forall t (implies (@ PBot t) (@ App h t t)))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4d7c2cdc85b4eb4f\" href=\"?note=4d7c2cdc85b4eb4f\" title=\"ZFC_FormSetL\">FormSetL</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b242e5082334b5f2\" href=\"?note=b242e5082334b5f2\" title=\"ZFC_Map\">Map</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627acf823af3c5\" title=\"ZFC_PAtom\">PAtom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8839a547e393d0af\" href=\"?note=8839a547e393d0af\" title=\"ZFC_PBot\">PBot</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1ee75039aeffe56b\" href=\"?note=1ee75039aeffe56b\" title=\"ZFC_PNeg\">PNeg</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{